{"_note":"配合 scripts/demo-e2e.mjs 与 e2e-fixtures/local-site/ 使用。用户名/密码来自环境变量 login_user（明文）与 login_password（密钥，执行时才解密注入），文件里不写任何凭证。","dslVersion":"1","name":"本地演示：登录旅程","steps":[{"comment":"打开本地登录页","id":"s1","type":"goto","url":"/login.html"},{"comment":"填写用户名（变量）","id":"s2","locator":{"strategy":"testid","value":"login-username"},"type":"fill","value":"{{login_user}}"},{"comment":"填写密码（密钥变量，仅内存解密）","id":"s3","locator":{"strategy":"testid","value":"login-password"},"type":"fill","value":"{{login_password}}"},{"comment":"点击登录","id":"s4","locator":{"strategy":"testid","value":"login-button"},"type":"click"},{"comment":"等待跳转欢迎页","id":"s5","type":"wait_for_url","url":"**/welcome.html*"},{"comment":"断言欢迎语含用户名","expected":"Welcome, {{login_user}}","id":"s6","locator":{"strategy":"testid","value":"greeting"},"type":"assert_text"},{"comment":"留痕截图（产物在 demo 中另行登记）","id":"s7","type":"screenshot"}]}